    "detailed_description": "1. Introduction: Game content:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou wake up from a nightmare and find yourself trapped in a gorgeous room.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd you have lost the memories before coming here.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn front of you are two doll girls with vastly different personalities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou become taskers carrying systems and need to shuttle through different inner worlds to complete tasks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe inner world is the nightmare of humanity and the demon of humanity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly one of the three of you can live to the end<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Introduction to game features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginal artwork tailored to each character's personality; unique painting style that makes every scene unique.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe plot revolves around survival puzzle solving and SRPG battle chess gameplay, providing you with a new experience. The small gameplay in the work is full of wit, and the colorful stories are vivid and vivid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIs it true or false? Is it obedience or combat? Should we shoulder the responsibility of this world and start from here\u201c<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Game gameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSRPG game chess, infinite flow plot, dual line light and dark, the main control perspective may not know the truth, everything in the dungeon is a hint",
